<p class="mb-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Names start with <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.auth.</code> on identity and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.email.</code> on email.</p>
<ul class="divide-y divide-border overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card">
  <li class="px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
    <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Job overdue</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.auth.scheduled.job.overdue</code> or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.email.scheduled.job.overdue</code> stays 1. That covers a stopped beat, a stuck worker, or a missing cron line.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
    <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Failing runs</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Failed runs of <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.auth.scheduled.job.runs</code> or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.email.scheduled.job.runs</code> keep increasing.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
    <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Scheduler Redis down</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.auth.scheduler.redis.up</code> or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.email.scheduler.redis.up</code> is 0.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
    <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Email lane worker down</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.email.lane.worker.up</code> is 0.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
    <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Webhooks given up</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.auth.scheduled.job.items</code> or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.email.scheduled.job.items</code> increases when <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">kind</code> is <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">webhook_deliveries_given_up</code>.</p>
  </li>
</ul>
